{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "Romdoul OCR API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Khmer document OCR over plain HTTP. Upload an image or PDF and get back text, layout regions, tables, and translations.\n\n**Three OCR engines answer the same five endpoints.** Swap the path prefix to switch engine — request and response shapes are identical:\n\n| Prefix | Engine | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `/api` | Khmer Parsing API (cloud GPU) | Best Khmer accuracy, translation, confidence scores. Default. |\n| `/api-vllm` | Surya OCR 2 (self-hosted GPU) | Private processing, adjustable render DPI. No translation. |\n| `/api-lens` | Google Lens | Fast general text. No confidence, no table structure. |\n\n### Access\nNo API key is required — if you have the endpoint, you can call it. Usage is **rate limited** instead: **120 requests/minute per client, bursting to 40**. Health checks get a looser budget. Exceed it and you get `429` with a `Retry-After` header; back off and continue.\n\n### Versioning\nAll paths are served under **`/v1`** — `https://romdoulocr.netlify.app/v1/api/ocr-image`. Build against `/v1` and a future breaking change will ship as `/v2` without touching you.\n\n### Idempotency\nAny POST accepts an optional **`Idempotency-Key`** header (any unique string — a UUID per source document works well). The first call runs normally; a repeat with the same key within **24 hours** replays the stored response instead of re-running OCR. Use it so a dropped connection or a pipeline retry never double-spends GPU time or produces a second, subtly different result. The response carries `X-Idempotency-Replay: HIT` when it was replayed.\n\n### Errors\nEvery failure returns `{ \"error\": { \"code\", \"message\" }, \"detail\" }`. Branch on the stable `error.code` — never on `detail`, which is prose meant for humans.\n\n### Practical notes\n- Send **one page per request** and run pages in parallel: it stays inside the ~26 s gateway ceiling, gives per-page progress, and fails narrowly on a bad page.\n- The cloud engine sleeps when idle; the first call after a quiet period can take ~22 s. Call `/v1/api/health` before a batch to absorb that once.\n- `full_text` is occasionally an empty string even when regions contain text — fall back to joining `pages[].regions[].text`.\n- Image fields (`crop_base64`, `debug_image`) are **raw base64**; prepend `data:image/png;base64,` yourself.\n- Retry `502`/`504` once with backoff (send the same `Idempotency-Key` — it's free if the first attempt actually landed). Never retry a `4xx` other than `429`."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://romdoulocr.netlify.app/v1",
      "description": "Public (browser-friendly; ~26 s request ceiling)"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://apt-server-desktop.tail806605.ts.net/v1",
      "description": "Direct (server-to-server; ~300 s ceiling — prefer this for batch jobs)"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:8181/v1",
      "description": "Local (home network)"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Khmer Parsing API",
      "description": "Cloud GPU engine — the default. Highest Khmer accuracy, supports translation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Surya OCR 2",
      "description": "Self-hosted GPU engine. Same contract; adds a `dpi` render-quality knob. No translation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Google Lens",
      "description": "No GPU required. Good general text and photos; no confidence scores or table structure."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Khmer Parsing API"
        ],
        "summary": "Health check",
        "description": "Cheap readiness probe. `200` means the engine will accept work. May take up to ~22 s on a cold start.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Engine ready",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthCheckResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unavailable"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/ocr-image": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Khmer Parsing API"
        ],
        "summary": "Read a single image",
        "description": "Returns the plain text of one image. No layout or structure — use `/parse-pdf` if you need either.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/UseCtc"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/SingleFile"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Extracted text",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OcrImageResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooLarge"
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadGateway"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/parse-pdf": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Khmer Parsing API"
        ],
        "summary": "Extract a document with layout",
        "description": "Full document extraction. Returns every page with its layout regions — headings, paragraphs, tables, figures — each with text, a bounding box, and a confidence score.\n\nThe `files` field is **plural** and repeatable: send it more than once to merge several inputs into a single document with renumbered pages.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DetectLayout"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DetectLines"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/UseCtc"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/MultiFile"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Parsed document",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DocumentResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooLarge"
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadGateway"
          },
          "504": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Timeout"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/parse-pdf-translated": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Khmer Parsing API"
        ],
        "summary": "Extract a document and translate it",
        "description": "Identical to `/parse-pdf`, plus `translated_text` on the response.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/SourceLang"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TargetLang"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DetectLayout"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/DetectLines"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/UseCtc"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/MultiFile"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Parsed document with translation",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DocumentResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadGateway"
          },
          "504": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Timeout"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/parse-table": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Khmer Parsing API"
        ],
        "summary": "Extract table structure",
        "description": "Returns rows, columns and cells — each cell with its grid position, text, bounding box and confidence, enough to rebuild the table as CSV or a spreadsheet.\n\nWhen no table is detected you get the page text as a single-column grid rather than an empty result.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/RowTolerance"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/UseCtc"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/SingleFile"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Table grid",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TableResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadGateway"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api-vllm/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Surya OCR 2"
        ],
        "summary": "Health check",
        "description": "Returns `503` with `models_loaded: false` when the GPU service is unreachable. This engine depends on a machine that is not always online — fall back to `/api` on `503`.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Engine ready",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthCheckResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unavailable"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api-vllm/ocr-image": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Surya OCR 2"
        ],
        "summary": "Read a single image",
        "description": "Images are preprocessed (deskew, upscale, sharpen) before recognition to meet the model's minimum input quality on old or blurry scans.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Dpi"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/SingleFile"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Extracted text",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OcrImageResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadGateway"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unavailable"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api-vllm/parse-pdf": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Surya OCR 2"
        ],
        "summary": "Extract a document with layout",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Dpi"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/MultiFile"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Parsed document",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DocumentResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadGateway"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unavailable"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api-vllm/parse-pdf-translated": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Surya OCR 2"
        ],
        "summary": "Extract a document (translation NOT supported)",
        "description": "Accepted for contract compatibility, but this engine cannot translate — `translated_text` is always `null`. Use `/api` or `/api-lens` for translation.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Dpi"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/MultiFile"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Parsed document, `translated_text` null",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DocumentResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unavailable"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api-vllm/parse-table": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Surya OCR 2"
        ],
        "summary": "Extract table structure",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Dpi"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/SingleFile"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Table grid",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TableResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unavailable"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api-lens/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Google Lens"
        ],
        "summary": "Health check",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Engine ready",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthCheckResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api-lens/ocr-image": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Google Lens"
        ],
        "summary": "Read a single image",
        "description": "`confidence` is always `0` — this engine does not report one.",
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/SingleFile"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Extracted text",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OcrImageResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadGateway"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api-lens/parse-pdf": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Google Lens"
        ],
        "summary": "Extract a document with layout",
        "description": "Words are grouped into lines by vertical proximity; one region per line. Region confidence is synthetic.",
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/MultiFile"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Parsed document",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DocumentResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadGateway"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api-lens/parse-pdf-translated": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Google Lens"
        ],
        "summary": "Extract a document and translate it",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/SourceLang"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TargetLang"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/MultiFile"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Parsed document with translation",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DocumentResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadGateway"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api-lens/parse-table": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Google Lens"
        ],
        "summary": "Extract table structure (best effort)",
        "description": "Lens has no table model. A grid is reconstructed from word geometry — rows by vertical proximity, columns by horizontal whitespace gaps — and falls back to a single-column line list when no columns are detected.",
        "requestBody": {
          "$ref": "#/components/requestBodies/SingleFile"
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Table grid",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TableResult"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadGateway"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "parameters": {
      "UseCtc": {
        "name": "use_ctc",
        "in": "query",
        "required": false,
        "description": "CTC decoder. Recommended for Khmer — the autoregressive decoder can fall into repetition loops on noisy scans.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true
        }
      },
      "DetectLayout": {
        "name": "detect_layout",
        "in": "query",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Detect layout regions. Turn off to force a single whole-page read (useful for signs and photos).",
        "schema": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true
        }
      },
      "DetectLines": {
        "name": "detect_lines",
        "in": "query",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Emit per-line bounding boxes inside each region.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true
        }
      },
      "SourceLang": {
        "name": "source_lang",
        "in": "query",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Source language hint, e.g. `km`.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "km"
        }
      },
      "TargetLang": {
        "name": "target_lang",
        "in": "query",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Target language, e.g. `en`.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "en"
        }
      },
      "RowTolerance": {
        "name": "row_tolerance",
        "in": "query",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Pixel slack when grouping cells into rows. Raise it for skewed scans.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "integer",
          "default": 20,
          "minimum": 1
        }
      },
      "Dpi": {
        "name": "dpi",
        "in": "query",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Render resolution for the self-hosted engine: 96 draft, 150 default, 300 for small print. Ignored by other engines.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "integer",
          "default": 150,
          "enum": [
            96,
            150,
            300
          ]
        }
      },
      "IdempotencyKey": {
        "name": "Idempotency-Key",
        "in": "header",
        "required": false,
        "description": "Optional. Any unique string (a UUID per source document works well). A repeat within 24 h replays the stored response instead of re-running OCR, so retries never double-spend GPU time. Response carries `X-Idempotency-Replay: HIT` when replayed.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "doc-4f8a21-page-3"
        }
      }
    },
    "requestBodies": {
      "SingleFile": {
        "required": true,
        "description": "Multipart upload. Field name is **`file`** (singular).",
        "content": {
          "multipart/form-data": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "file"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "file": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "binary",
                  "description": "PNG, JPG, WEBP, BMP or TIFF"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "MultiFile": {
        "required": true,
        "description": "Multipart upload. Field name is **`files`** (plural, repeatable).",
        "content": {
          "multipart/form-data": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "files"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "files": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "binary"
                  },
                  "description": "PDF or image files. Repeat the field to merge several into one document."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "BadRequest": {
        "description": "Malformed request — check the upload field name (`file` singular vs `files` plural)",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TooLarge": {
        "description": "Upload exceeds 100 MB — split the document",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "BadGateway": {
        "description": "The engine failed. Retry once with backoff.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Unavailable": {
        "description": "Engine not ready (GPU loading or offline). Poll `/health`, or fall back to `/api`.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Timeout": {
        "description": "Upstream timed out — send fewer pages per request",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "RateLimited": {
        "description": "Rate limit exceeded (120 req/min per client, burst 40). Back off and retry.",
        "headers": {
          "Retry-After": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Seconds to wait"
          }
        },
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Error": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Machine-readable. Branch on `code`.",
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "Stable error identifier.",
                "enum": [
                  "rate_limited",
                  "payload_too_large",
                  "engine_unreachable",
                  "engine_timeout",
                  "engine_not_ready",
                  "bad_request",
                  "input_declined"
                ]
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "What went wrong and what to do about it."
              },
              "retry_after": {
                "type": "integer",
                "nullable": true,
                "description": "Seconds to wait (rate_limited only)."
              }
            }
          },
          "detail": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Human-readable prose. Do NOT branch on this."
          }
        },
        "example": {
          "error": {
            "code": "rate_limited",
            "message": "Too many requests. Retry after the Retry-After interval.",
            "retry_after": 30
          },
          "detail": "Rate limit exceeded"
        }
      },
      "HealthCheckResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "ok"
          },
          "models_loaded": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "example": "All models loaded and ready"
          }
        }
      },
      "OcrImageResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float",
            "description": "0–1. Always 0 on the Google Lens engine.",
            "example": 0.94
          },
          "filename": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "decoder": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "ctc"
          }
        },
        "example": {
          "filename": "scan.png",
          "text": "ព្រះរាជាណាចក្រកម្ពុជា",
          "confidence": 0.94,
          "decoder": "ctc"
        }
      },
      "BoundingBox": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Four corners in page-pixel space, clockwise from top-left — a rotated region keeps its true shape.",
        "properties": {
          "points": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "minItems": 2,
              "maxItems": 2
            },
            "minItems": 4,
            "maxItems": 4,
            "example": [
              [
                120,
                340
              ],
              [
                880,
                340
              ],
              [
                880,
                402
              ],
              [
                120,
                402
              ]
            ]
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float"
          }
        }
      },
      "TextLine": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float"
          },
          "bbox": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BoundingBox"
          },
          "khmer_text": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "english_text": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          }
        }
      },
      "LayoutRegion": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "region_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "text",
              "title",
              "section-header",
              "table",
              "list-item",
              "caption",
              "footnote",
              "picture",
              "figure"
            ]
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float"
          },
          "bbox": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BoundingBox"
          },
          "lines": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TextLine"
            }
          },
          "crop_base64": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "RAW base64 PNG (no data: prefix) for picture/figure regions"
          },
          "khmer_text": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "english_text": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          }
        }
      },
      "PageResult": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "page_number": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 1
          },
          "width": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 1654
          },
          "height": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 2339
          },
          "regions": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LayoutRegion"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "DocumentResult": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "filename": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "num_pages": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "pages": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PageResult"
            }
          },
          "full_text": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "May be an empty string even when regions contain text — fall back to joining region text."
          },
          "translated_text": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "table_crops": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "figure_crops": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "image_crops": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TableCell": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "row": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "col": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "float"
          },
          "bbox": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BoundingBox"
          }
        }
      },
      "TableResult": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "filename": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "num_rows": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 12
          },
          "num_cols": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 5
          },
          "cells": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TableCell"
            }
          },
          "structured_text": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Tab-separated rows"
          },
          "width": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "height": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "debug_image": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "description": "RAW base64 PNG (no data: prefix)"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
